msgstr "<action>निर्गम</action> &skladnik;."

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:282
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Animation Menu"
msgstr "एनिमेशन मेनू इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:284
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This menu offers menu items with check boxes that allow you to specify the "
"speed to which the movement replay animations are shown at."
msgstr ""
"एतत् मेन्यू चेक् बॉक्स्-सहितं मेनू-वस्तूनि प्रदाति यत् भवन्तः गति-पुनः-प्ले "
"एनिमेशन्स् यस्मिन् वेगे दर्शिताः इति निर्दिष्टुं शक्नुवन्ति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:290
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Animation</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Slow</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>एनिमेशन</guimenu> <guisubmenu>मन्द</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:295
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show replay animations at a slow pace."
msgstr "मन्दगत्या पुनः प्ले एनिमेशनं दर्शयतु।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:300
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Animation</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Medium</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>एनिमेशन</guimenu> <guisubmenu>मध्यम</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:305
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the default setting, and <action>shows replay animations at a "
"slightly faster pace</action>."
msgstr ""
"एतत् पूर्वनिर्धारितं सेटिङ्ग् अस्ति, तथा च <action>किञ्चित् द्रुततरगत्या "
"पुनः प्ले एनिमेशनं दर्शयति</action> ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:310
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Animation</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Fast</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>एनिमेशन</guimenu> <guisubmenu>द्रुत</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:315
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show replay animations at the fastest pace."
msgstr "द्रुततमगत्या पुनः प्ले एनिमेशनं दर्शयतु।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:320
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Animation</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Off</guisubmenu>"
msgstr "<guimenu>एनिमेशन</guimenu> <guisubmenu>निष्क्रान्त</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:325
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not animate replay animations."
msgstr "पुनः प्ले एनिमेशनं न सजीवं कुर्वन्तु।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:334
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Bookmarks Menu"
msgstr "बुकमार्क मेनू इति"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:338
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Bookmarks</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Set Bookmark</guisubmenu>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>पुस्तकचिह्नानि</guimenu> <guisubmenu>पुस्तकचिह्नानि सेट् "
"कुर्वन्तु</guisubmenu>"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:343
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&skladnik; allows you to <action>set bookmarks with a level at a particular "
"state.</action> You might use this to save yourself repeating the same "
"initial steps in a level."
msgstr ""
"&स्क्लद्निक; भवन्तं <action>एकस्मिन् विशेषे अवस्थायां स्तरेन सह "
"पुस्तकचिह्नानि सेट् कर्तुं शक्नोति ।</action> भवान् एतत् उपयोक्तुं शक्नोति "
"यत् भवान् कस्मिन् अपि स्तरे समानानि प्रारम्भिकपदानि पुनरावृत्तिं कृत्वा "
"स्वयमेव रक्षितुं शक्नोति ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:346
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can have up to ten bookmarks at a time, and access them via the "
"<keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap><replaceable>X</replaceable></keycap></"
"keycombo> shortcut, where <replaceable>X</replaceable> is any digit between "
"0 and 9."
msgstr ""
"भवान् एकस्मिन् समये दश पुस्तकचिह्नानि यावत् भवितुं शक्नोति, तथा च <keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap><replaceable>X</replaceable></keycap></"
"keycombo> शॉर्टकट् मार्गेण तान् अभिगन्तुं शक्नोति, यत्र <replaceable "
">X</replaceable> इति 0 तः 9 पर्यन्तं कोऽपि अङ्कः ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:353
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Bookmarks</guimenu> <guisubmenu>Go to Bookmark</guisubmenu>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>पुस्तकचिह्नानि</guimenu> <guisubmenu>पुस्तकचिह्नानि</guisubmenu> "
"इति गच्छन्तु"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:358
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Jump to a state you have previously saved as a bookmark."
msgstr "पूर्वं भवता बुकमार्करूपेण रक्षितां अवस्थां प्रति कूदन्तु ।"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:366
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Help Menu"
msgstr "सहायता मेनू"

# automatic translation
#: index.docbook:368
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&skladnik; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu item, for more "
"information read the section about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help Menu</ulink> of the "
"&kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"&स्क्लद्निक; सामान्यं &kde; <guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तु, "
"अधिकसूचनार्थं &kde; मौलिकता।"

